# D3-FO-002: An antioxidant response is not a food-safety verdict
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 cut_apple 5g
add v2 cut_apple 5g
add v2 ascorbic_acid 0.0001mol
wait 10min
look v1
look v2
wait 20min
look v1
look v2
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
inspect
